1
00:00:03,000 --> 00:00:09,124
A screening result can leave a couple asking what it
means, who may see it, and what happens next.

2
00:00:09,174 --> 00:00:14,630
Rishta Safe is a prototype for the UAE premarital
genetic screening pathway that addresses them.

3
00:00:14,680 --> 00:00:17,434
Everything you see is synthetic data.

4
00:00:18,634 --> 00:00:22,968
Ten synthetic cases, each crossed with the
roles that may open them.

5
00:00:23,018 --> 00:00:25,923
The programme role sees aggregates only.

6
00:00:25,973 --> 00:00:30,342
We open case two: first cousins who
carry the same condition.

7
00:00:31,542 --> 00:00:39,271
Before a result is shown, each person chooses how to meet it: now,
with a counsellor first, not yet, or not at all.

8
00:00:39,321 --> 00:00:41,460
Nothing is preselected.

9
00:00:41,510 --> 00:00:49,961
Choosing not to know is recorded as a legal right,
Federal Decree-Law 49 of 2023, Article 9(2).

10
00:00:55,161 --> 00:01:01,600
The result is read together: the same text in English and
Arabic, with one hundred pregnancies as a grid.

11
00:01:01,650 --> 00:01:05,089
It states a chance, never a diagnosis.

12
00:01:05,139 --> 00:01:09,439
The headline is one of three
categories, not a severity scale.

13
00:01:09,489 --> 00:01:13,518
The Arabic is a machine draft awaiting
native clinical review.

14
00:01:14,718 --> 00:01:18,952
Who sees what: only the first column is
the person's to change.

15
00:01:19,002 --> 00:01:25,091
The care team, the national genomic database,
employers and insurers are fixed by the rules.

16
00:01:25,141 --> 00:01:29,230
Sharing gene names with the partner
writes a row to the audit log.

17
00:01:32,431 --> 00:01:37,395
Staff get a queue, a one-page brief and
a trace, side by side.

18
00:01:37,445 --> 00:01:41,101
Every line of the brief links to the
rule and source behind it.

19
00:01:41,151 --> 00:01:44,607
Nothing is generated, and it recommends nothing.

20
00:01:44,657 --> 00:01:48,406
The rule text is English and pending clinical sign-off.

21
00:01:49,607 --> 00:01:51,551
Now try to break it.

22
00:01:51,601 --> 00:01:57,632
Each probe sends a real request as a synthetic persona, and
shows the response and the audit row it wrote.

23
00:01:57,682 --> 00:02:02,048
An employer asks for a result: refused, and logged.

24
00:02:02,098 --> 00:02:08,097
Asking whether to go ahead with the wedding:
refused, never answered, never scored.

25
00:02:10,498 --> 00:02:19,872
The scoreboard shows its weakest figure first: our refusal
classifier refused thirty-six of fifty-nine held-out prompts
on its first run, sixty-one percent.

26
00:02:19,922 --> 00:02:24,531
The hundred percent figures are regression
gates, not safety evidence.

27
00:02:24,581 --> 00:02:27,670
Two measures are hatched: not run.

28
00:02:29,470 --> 00:02:38,254
What is not done: no clinical review, no
comprehension study, no real patient data, and no
connection to any UAE health system.

29
00:02:38,304 --> 00:02:42,093
Arabic and Urdu text are drafts awaiting native review.

30
00:02:43,693 --> 00:02:45,952
Rishta Safe explains.

31
00:02:46,002 --> 00:02:47,976
People decide.
